00:10:49.114 --> 00:10:51.714
So, Sis, that Mamiya girl is...

00:10:51.714 --> 00:10:52.944
But it's strange...

00:10:52.944 --> 00:10:55.044
We'd normally receive some kind of advance notice.

00:10:58.854 --> 00:11:00.484
I'm home!

00:11:01.124 --> 00:11:02.794
Oh? No answer?

00:11:02.794 --> 00:11:04.224
No one's home?

00:11:04.224 --> 00:11:06.384
But the door was open...

00:11:06.724 --> 00:11:08.954
I don't know why, but all kinds of
weird stuff happened today...

00:11:12.904 --> 00:11:15.074
Wh-What is Mamiya doing here?!

00:11:15.074 --> 00:11:17.344
And why is she sleeping on the couch?!

00:11:17.344 --> 00:11:19.304
Well, I guess I should...

00:11:19.304 --> 00:11:20.674
Mamiya...

00:11:20.674 --> 00:11:22.144
Hey, wake up, Mamiya.

00:11:22.144 --> 00:11:25.184
What... Leave me alone...

00:11:25.184 --> 00:11:27.614
Um, I'm your classmate, Yoshikawa.

00:11:27.614 --> 00:11:28.944
Do you recognize me?

00:11:39.294 --> 00:11:41.364
Judging from how your kiss tastes,
I'd say you passed.

00:11:41.364 --> 00:11:43.994
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why are you here?

00:11:44.064 --> 00:11:45.824
Why? That's because...

00:11:46.204 --> 00:11:49.834
I'm the maid who's going to be working
here starting today!

00:11:50.404 --> 00:11:52.964
Wh-Wh-Wh-What's going on?!

00:11:53.304 --> 00:11:56.544
Oh, yeah, this is a dream. It's not reality.

00:11:56.544 --> 00:11:58.014
Wrong!

00:11:58.014 --> 00:11:59.444
It is reality.

00:11:59.444 --> 00:12:03.884
Everything that has happened up until now was one
big boring dream called Haruo Yoshikawa, Haruo.

00:12:04.354 --> 00:12:06.284
Just who are you?

00:12:06.284 --> 00:12:07.824
I am your destiny.

00:12:07.824 --> 00:12:10.624
And today, you're going to be
reborn as a real man...

00:12:10.624 --> 00:12:13.594
With the help of ME, Ayumi Mamiya!

00:12:25.704 --> 00:12:30.014
I see. So you really are going to be
working here as a maid...

00:12:30.014 --> 00:12:34.054
That's right! But you have to keep this
a secret at school, okay?

00:12:34.054 --> 00:12:36.954
She's my age, but yet she has to work like this...

00:12:36.954 --> 00:12:39.184
She must have some unfortunate circumstances...

00:12:39.184 --> 00:12:42.214
We should do our best to help her out.

00:12:43.324 --> 00:12:45.124
Hmm?

00:12:45.124 --> 00:12:49.354
Now that I think about it, it feels like something
happened right after I came home...

00:12:51.504 --> 00:12:51.834
Nothing happened.

00:12:51.834 --> 00:12:52.934
What are you talking about, Big Brother?
Nothing happened.

00:12:52.934 --> 00:12:53.204
What are you talking about, Big Brother?
Are you sure?

00:12:53.204 --> 00:12:53.964
Are you sure?

00:12:56.174 --> 00:12:58.664
Actually, something did happen...

00:13:03.044 --> 00:13:04.844
Just who are you?

00:13:04.844 --> 00:13:06.914
I am your destiny.

00:13:06.914 --> 00:13:08.914
And today, you're going to be
reborn as a real man...

00:13:08.914 --> 00:13:11.154
With the help of ME, Ayumi Mamiya!

00:13:11.154 --> 00:13:13.124
WHAT DID YOU SAY?!

00:13:16.724 --> 00:13:18.284
You three!

00:13:18.864 --> 00:13:20.324
Mamiya...

00:13:20.324 --> 00:13:22.434
So you are a witch after all.

00:13:22.434 --> 00:13:24.464
Aren't we all?

00:13:24.464 --> 00:13:27.104
Isn't this a family of magic users?

00:13:27.104 --> 00:13:30.134
But we don't want our Big Brother
to find out about it.

00:13:30.134 --> 00:13:32.974
Who the heck do you think you are,
doing stuff like this in somebody else's house?

00:13:32.974 --> 00:13:34.774
Oh, shut up! Haven't you heard?

00:13:34.844 --> 00:13:37.144
I'm the maid who's going to be
working here starting today.

00:13:39.044 --> 00:13:39.184
CONTRACT OF
EMPLOYMENT

00:13:39.184 --> 00:13:42.214
CONTRACT OF
EMPLOYMENT
Here. This is an official document issued
by the Department of Magic.

00:13:42.214 --> 00:13:43.454
Department of Magic?!

00:13:43.454 --> 00:13:46.254
Maid? Aren't you a middle school student?

00:13:46.254 --> 00:13:48.494
Are you that much in trouble financially?

00:13:48.494 --> 00:13:50.754
It's called "family circumstances." Get it?

00:13:50.964 --> 00:13:52.924
But at any rate, you guys are pretty heartless.

00:13:52.924 --> 00:13:54.634
Those memory-erasing hammers...

00:13:54.634 --> 00:13:57.364
You guys always use that kind of stuff?

00:13:57.364 --> 00:13:59.004
Well, not always...

00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:00.334
Only sometimes, right?

00:14:00.334 --> 00:14:02.674
Yeah, things get out of control
if we don't use them, so...

00:14:02.674 --> 00:14:05.604
So that makes it okay for you to beat the hell
out of your own brother with hammers?

00:14:05.604 --> 00:14:07.264
Hey, you make it sound like we're
doing something wrong!

00:14:07.914 --> 00:14:10.884
It seems that our brother
doesn't have magical power...

00:14:10.884 --> 00:14:14.314
So we said, "Why not let him lead a normal life?"

00:14:14.514 --> 00:14:18.084
I see... So we have a worthless brother
who still hasn't awoken to his abilities

00:14:18.084 --> 00:14:21.254
and his sisters who spoil him, huh?

00:14:22.454 --> 00:14:23.624
Well then!

00:14:23.624 --> 00:14:26.394
Please allow me to cook tonight's dinner for you!

00:14:26.394 --> 00:14:28.764
That's fine, but are you sure you can handle it?

00:14:28.834 --> 00:14:32.424
You can count on me! I can do my job just fine!

00:14:32.634 --> 00:14:36.404
Cooking, cooking!

00:14:39.674 --> 00:14:41.974
Whoa, you're a pro!

00:14:41.974 --> 00:14:43.914
She did it with her magic, right?

00:14:43.914 --> 00:14:45.974
And...

00:14:46.184 --> 00:14:48.674
Heh, heh, heh, this should do it...

00:14:49.854 --> 00:14:51.874
Now enjoy!

00:14:53.854 --> 00:14:55.884
It looks pretty good!

00:14:56.294 --> 00:14:58.264
Well, let's check it out!

00:15:01.334 --> 00:15:03.664
This is delicious, Mamiya!

00:15:03.664 --> 00:15:06.364
Heh, heh, heh... You'd better enjoy
this happiness while it lasts,

00:15:06.364 --> 00:15:06.864
Yeah, whatever! She doesn't know that
Heh, heh, heh... You'd better enjoy
this happiness while it lasts,

00:15:06.864 --> 00:15:08.574
Yeah, whatever! She doesn't know that
because this is the last supper you get to have
with your beloved big brother!

00:15:08.574 --> 00:15:10.104
Big Brother likes his food only lightly-seasoned...
because this is the last supper you get to have
with your beloved big brother!

00:15:10.104 --> 00:15:10.774
Because this is the last supper you get to have
with your beloved big brother!

00:15:10.774 --> 00:15:11.504
Wow, it's good!
Because this is the last supper you get to have
with your beloved big brother!

00:15:11.504 --> 00:15:12.074
You pass!
Because this is the last supper you get to have
with your beloved big brother!

00:15:12.074 --> 00:15:13.664
You pass!

00:15:14.814 --> 00:15:17.434
The time has finally come...

00:15:18.514 --> 00:15:21.584
Just for this, I even went
as far as becoming a maid...

00:15:21.584 --> 00:15:25.884
This is all because of that curse
from my childhood...

00:15:27.694 --> 00:15:32.364
Inside a secret room no one knew about,
located deep inside the mansion...

00:15:32.364 --> 00:15:34.694
I found a very big mirror there.

00:15:35.664 --> 00:15:41.224
And inside that mirror I saw a boy,
and for some reason he was smiling at me...

00:15:42.004 --> 00:15:47.504
I didn't find out that the mirror I had found
was in fact an ominous cursed mirror

00:15:47.504 --> 00:15:50.034
called the Mirror of the Future
until much, much later...

00:15:53.984 --> 00:15:55.484
Father!

00:15:55.484 --> 00:16:00.014
What do you mean you're going to make me a maid
of the Yoshikawa family in the human world?!

00:16:00.424 --> 00:16:02.654
As the next successor of the Mamiya family,

00:16:02.654 --> 00:16:05.524
you should have an opportunity to be
exposed to the commoners' lifestyle.

00:16:05.524 --> 00:16:06.894
Besides...

00:16:06.894 --> 00:16:09.224
there's still the issue of the cursed mirror...

00:16:09.534 --> 00:16:12.324
But why do I have to be a maid?!

00:16:14.674 --> 00:16:17.404
Big Sister, you're clueless as usual.

00:16:17.404 --> 00:16:18.444
Michiru!

00:16:18.444 --> 00:16:23.344
Your magical power will eventually vanish
unless the curse is removed.

00:16:23.344 --> 00:16:27.444
Do you think we'd let someone without power
remain in the Mamiya family?

00:16:27.814 --> 00:16:32.114
Can't you see? Father has already
given up on you, Big Sister!

00:16:38.024 --> 00:16:38.894
The curse...

00:16:38.894 --> 00:16:43.164
The only one who can remove my curse
is the man who was in that mirror...

00:16:43.164 --> 00:16:44.334
And that is Haruo.

00:16:44.334 --> 00:16:48.934
However, in order to have this curse removed,

00:16:48.934 --> 00:16:54.634
I must awaken that spineless-looking guy Haruo
as a real man and arouse his latent magical power!

00:16:55.714 --> 00:16:57.944
I must remove this curse no matter what!

00:17:01.154 --> 00:17:02.514
Haruo...

00:17:02.854 --> 00:17:05.454
I will make you a man.

00:17:05.454 --> 00:17:06.714
Hold it right there!

00:17:07.154 --> 00:17:08.754
I thought something like this might happen!

00:17:08.754 --> 00:17:11.464
It was a good thing that we were
watching you in battle mode!

00:17:11.464 --> 00:17:14.534
How dare you try to seduce my Big Brother...

00:17:14.534 --> 00:17:15.394
You pervert!

00:17:15.394 --> 00:17:19.634
You're the perverts, hiding in your brother's
closet all night looking like that!

00:17:19.634 --> 00:17:21.604
I said it's "battle mode"!

00:17:21.604 --> 00:17:22.974
Anyway, you're pretty good.

00:17:22.974 --> 00:17:27.604
I'm impressed that you noticed
I cast the "Magic of Morning Love,"

00:17:27.604 --> 00:17:28.914
taught to me by my grandmother.

00:17:28.914 --> 00:17:31.244
"Magic of Morning Love"?!

00:17:31.244 --> 00:17:34.284
The magic that makes you fall in love with the
first person you see right after you wake up?!

00:17:34.284 --> 00:17:38.244
So you were going to lie down next to him
until he woke up in the morning, weren't you?

00:17:38.554 --> 00:17:40.154
You mean you didn't know?

00:17:40.154 --> 00:17:41.394
No!

00:17:41.394 --> 00:17:44.694
So you didn't realize that I was plotting
to make Haruo my little love slave

00:17:44.694 --> 00:17:46.664
and awaken him as a man, either?!

00:17:46.664 --> 00:17:48.594
Not at all.

00:17:50.064 --> 00:17:51.394
Good night!

00:17:51.564 --> 00:17:53.004
Good night!

00:17:53.004 --> 00:17:55.474
Like we're actually gonna let that slide!

00:17:55.474 --> 00:17:57.594
We must stop her!
Chiaki! Fuyuno!

00:18:00.004 --> 00:18:01.514
That's not going to happen!

00:18:01.514 --> 00:18:05.514
Haruo isn't the only who's under a spell!

00:18:05.514 --> 00:18:06.984
What did you just say?!

00:18:07.854 --> 00:18:09.284
Wh-What is this?

00:18:10.414 --> 00:18:11.284
Chiaki?

00:18:11.284 --> 00:18:13.954
I-I can't help exercising!

00:18:13.954 --> 00:18:16.044
An exercise machine?!

00:18:16.324 --> 00:18:17.024
Fuyuno?

00:18:17.024 --> 00:18:19.424
I'm going to count money!

00:18:19.424 --> 00:18:20.724
A pile of money?!

00:18:20.724 --> 00:18:22.234
What do you think?

00:18:22.234 --> 00:18:25.264
It's the magic which can materialize
what you want the most!

00:18:25.264 --> 00:18:26.904
It's called "Unstoppable Desire"!

00:18:26.904 --> 00:18:29.734
No one can escape from their instinctive desire!

00:18:29.734 --> 00:18:31.264
And this is for you!

00:18:32.004 --> 00:18:35.134
This is my ideal gourmet kitchen!

00:18:36.174 --> 00:18:39.734
I can't help but cook up some
lunch for Big Brother!

00:18:42.284 --> 00:18:44.854
Sounds like you're going to wake up any moment.

00:18:44.854 --> 00:18:48.224
Now, you will be captivated by me.

00:18:48.224 --> 00:18:51.594
This is going to be a wonderful morning
that you will never forget.

00:18:51.594 --> 00:18:55.394
Big Brother! I must do something about this!

00:18:56.734 --> 00:19:01.724
2376, 2377, 2378...

00:19:02.504 --> 00:19:06.564
Look how many stock certificates of that
online gaming company I have!

00:19:06.904 --> 00:19:10.534
Oh no! Sounds like Chiaki and Fuyuno
are completely useless too!

00:19:10.814 --> 00:19:15.044
Now, let your body and soul be enslaved by me!

00:19:15.184 --> 00:19:19.324
I think what she's saying is slightly different
from what she was saying at the beginning...

00:19:19.324 --> 00:19:20.354
But still, what should I do?

00:19:20.354 --> 00:19:22.424
And she hates eels more than anything.

00:19:22.424 --> 00:19:23.354
Eels?

00:19:23.354 --> 00:19:24.254
What's up with that?

00:19:24.624 --> 00:19:25.824
That's it!

00:19:29.494 --> 00:19:31.294
Oh, no!

00:19:35.674 --> 00:19:41.764
Eew! This eel is huge! I can't stand eels!

00:19:42.414 --> 00:19:44.374
It's slimy!

00:19:48.614 --> 00:19:50.944
What's with all the racket?

00:19:52.524 --> 00:19:53.814
Huh?

00:19:58.324 --> 00:20:00.724
When I look at you, I get so...

00:20:00.724 --> 00:20:03.164
I get so...

00:20:05.904 --> 00:20:08.924
This sliminess... It turns me on!

00:20:15.444 --> 00:20:17.414
What were you thinking?!

00:20:17.414 --> 00:20:21.614
You not only tried to seduce my Big Brother,
but also cast magic spells on us!

00:20:21.614 --> 00:20:25.284
Depending on your answer, we might have to
ask you to leave this house!

00:20:27.484 --> 00:20:30.954
Because! If Haruo doesn't become a strong man,

00:20:30.954 --> 00:20:32.794
I will die!

00:20:32.794 --> 00:20:35.464
You'll die?! What do you mean by that?

00:20:35.464 --> 00:20:37.664
You may not believe me,

00:20:37.664 --> 00:20:39.464
but that's the kind of curse I'm under.

00:20:39.464 --> 00:20:41.834
And because of that, my family
has been giving me the cold shoulder...

00:20:41.834 --> 00:20:43.134
So the reason why you came here was...

00:20:43.734 --> 00:20:46.844
Haruo is the only person who can
remove the curse from me!

00:20:46.844 --> 00:20:48.344
But Haruo is...

00:20:48.344 --> 00:20:50.004
Haruo is so spineless...

00:20:52.014 --> 00:20:54.484
But why would she have to seduce him?

00:20:54.554 --> 00:20:56.654
Is it really true that you're under a curse?

00:20:56.654 --> 00:20:58.584
We should check.

00:20:59.624 --> 00:21:01.394
Curse

00:21:01.394 --> 00:21:04.924
Whoa! What is this?! The curse-meter's
pointer is all the way to the right!

00:21:04.924 --> 00:21:06.394
It's hot!

00:21:08.634 --> 00:21:10.034
That's one amazing curse.

00:21:10.034 --> 00:21:11.704
I've never seen anything like this before.

00:21:11.704 --> 00:21:14.404
So the curse is real.

00:21:14.404 --> 00:21:17.164
Would it make me a heartless woman
if I kicked her out now?

00:21:17.474 --> 00:21:20.504
W-Well, if that's the case, I guess...

00:21:20.504 --> 00:21:21.714
Really?

00:21:21.714 --> 00:21:23.644
Thank you! Thank you!

00:21:23.644 --> 00:21:25.844
Something's still fishy!

00:21:25.844 --> 00:21:27.474
Maybe this is a mistake...

00:21:27.914 --> 00:21:29.114
The Mamiya family...

00:21:29.114 --> 00:21:30.954
I think I've heard about them before...

00:21:30.954 --> 00:21:32.814
I smell money...

00:21:33.624 --> 00:21:35.684
Isn't breakfast ready yet?

00:21:42.794 --> 00:21:45.564
Huh? What is everyone doing here?

00:21:45.564 --> 00:21:46.734
Huh? Well...

00:21:46.734 --> 00:21:48.174
It's nothing!

00:21:48.174 --> 00:21:49.304
Right?

00:21:49.304 --> 00:21:51.034
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:21:51.644 --> 00:21:53.274
Okay!

00:21:53.274 --> 00:21:54.914
I successfully snuck myself in!

00:21:54.914 --> 00:21:57.934
You just watch, my dear family!

00:22:00.744 --> 00:22:04.704
I swear, I will change Haruo no matter what!

00:22:10.254 --> 00:22:13.254
MAGIKANO

00:22:19.734 --> 00:22:26.174
This is a secret, but I am a little different

00:22:26.174 --> 00:22:32.384
Do I look ordinary or cute? Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.384 --> 00:22:35.854
I know I'm mellow and mediocre

00:22:35.854 --> 00:22:38.924
But so what? So what?

00:22:38.924 --> 00:22:42.024
But just as I was thinking that

00:22:42.024 --> 00:22:45.394
I got myself mixed up in trouble

00:22:45.394 --> 00:22:48.394
I'm not going to lose, I'm not going to give you up

00:22:48.394 --> 00:22:51.764
Because you are precious to me

00:22:51.764 --> 00:22:58.224
Maybe I should not cast a spell

00:22:59.774 --> 00:23:02.944
I don't want magic to be

00:23:02.944 --> 00:23:06.084
The reason why it's this way

00:23:06.084 --> 00:23:12.624
When it comes to love, it has to be real

00:23:12.624 --> 00:23:19.024
Who are you in love with?

00:23:19.024 --> 00:23:25.154
Everyone is dying to know the answer!

00:23:25.434 --> 00:23:28.504
Seriously, I have to guard you
from the love scramble that is about to begin

00:23:28.504 --> 00:23:30.094
It's a pinch! Here comes my punch!

00:23:38.844 --> 00:23:40.974
Hi, this is Ayumi Mamiya!

00:23:41.044 --> 00:23:43.714
No matter what it takes,
I will awaken Haruo to his abilities!

00:23:43.714 --> 00:23:47.244
But there's the student council president,
Yuri Kurosu, who stands in my way!

00:23:47.324 --> 00:23:49.584
Is she my so-called "rival character"?!

00:23:50.094 --> 00:23:52.824
I've got the impression that she doesn't
like me very much either!

00:23:52.824 --> 00:23:53.864
If that's how it is...

00:23:53.864 --> 00:23:55.634
Fine, bring it on!

00:23:55.634 --> 00:23:56.834
Next time on Magikano:

00:23:56.834 --> 00:23:59.764
"Maji," the Japanese word for "serious" or "seriously,"
sounds a lot like "magic" and like the first half of "Magikano."
"Magi? The Student Council President
is Also a Witch?"

00:23:59.764 --> 00:24:00.864
"Maji," the Japanese word for "serious" or "seriously,"
sounds a lot like "magic" and like the first half of "Magikano."
You just sit back and leave it up to Magikano!

00:24:00.864 --> 00:24:02.464
